WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.270
Act 1.

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:07.240
A girl, not yet fourteen, stands silent
while two adults talk over her head.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.390
When she does speak,
she's careful: "Madam,

4
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.590
I am here.

5
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.880
What is your will?"

6
00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.720
A husband is suggested.

7
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:18.560
Her answer: "It is an
honour that I dream not of."

8
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:19.740
Act 3.

9
00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:22.570
Now she faces her furious father.

10
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.920
So why does the obedient
daughter start to defy them?

11
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:31.240
In this mission, you'll see how much power
a father held in an Elizabethan family.

12
00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:35.230
You'll face Capulet's fury when
she refuses to marry Paris.

13
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.030
And you'll watch the
Nurse, her closest adult,

14
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.750
change her advice.

15
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.880
Your mission: explain why
Juliet starts to defy them.
